{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2021-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1633046400, "end_date": 1635724799, "month_true_total": 13, "quota": 13, "returned": 13, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:53:24 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "101988360", "author": {"steamid": "76561199073393504", "personaname": "Tea", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/arizonateaisverygood/", "num_games_owned": 91, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 1260, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 891, "last_played": 1699736108, "avatar": "8a0f4b765f79c512bd0f8587fcec1483ff7a8b95"}, "language": "english", "review": "ending very sad :(", "timestamp_created": 1635712000, "timestamp_updated": 1635712000, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 9, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.577764153480529785", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101830057", "author": {"steamid": "76561197994192237", "personaname": "Astronaut Teemo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197994192237/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 9642, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6030, "last_played": 1720836751, "avatar": "c26286f1a292309692f9a3a04eed8e0b8c15c66b"}, "language": "english", "review": "To be clear, I LOVE this game, but I do not recommend buying unless you are confident in your abilities to edit the game in your computer's program files. EA's stupid insistance that this game be played while connected to the Origin launcher but IN steam has caused massive headaches for me. I'll have played it for a character and then wait a few months before wanting to play it again but then an update in origin or something or other will prevent it from connecting and I cant even physically start the game. If you can buy this on console, DO IT. Or bite the bullet and just buy it through the Origin launcher. Steam and Origin do not play well together which breaks my heart because Mass Effect is such a great game.", "timestamp_created": 1635530457, "timestamp_updated": 1635530457, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.556516706943511963", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101734765", "author": {"steamid": "76561198296818751", "personaname": "BuBullen", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198296818751/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 1375, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1375, "last_played": 1635380660, "avatar": "a7c9114cb7bc27df464aa29f73a6ed2c1cf3b555"}, "language": "english", "review": "ending is....... hmph.", "timestamp_created": 1635384553, "timestamp_updated": 1635384553, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492307692766189575", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101666664", "author": {"steamid": "76561198093964883", "personaname": "Oh man", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198093964883/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1430, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 181, "last_played": 1668767286, "avatar": "de7aed4299406a52b01b0fc087ec5eb1d380b7e7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bought this game due to my enjoyment with mass effect 1 and 2 NOT KNOWING the issue about Mass effect 3 unable to starting on Steam. And yeah I almost got frustrated as I haven't read any solutions or workaround to make the game run. I made it work once and I thought it would be nice to share if you're someone like me who already bought it. \n\nI notice that time the my computer was at the following state:\n\n- MSI Afterburner turned off (or any GPU monitoring)\n- Web torrent (utorrent) not running\n- Origin app is online (this can be offline if it is not allowed by Windows defender firewall - add Origin as exception)\n- Riot vanguard client - for most people who play Valorant\n\nLet me know if this helps. \n\nStill, Steam or Origin needs to take action to fix this awesome game. Its 2021 and I still bought it. What a waste to let this bug hinder other players from the experience.\nHave fun! Thanks!", "timestamp_created": 1635260920, "timestamp_updated": 1635260920, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101539140", "author": {"steamid": "76561198988558041", "personaname": "irfanmufid", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/imfdr/", "num_games_owned": 146, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 1716, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1716, "last_played": 1613836294, "avatar": "97caee00eb9e2fd9f78eaf034b7f9f4d2fd9210d"}, "language": "english", "review": "not bad", "timestamp_created": 1635061864, "timestamp_updated": 1635061864, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactio